{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":11,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":855,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1900284,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":283927,"Name":"Diana2501","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1436740073,"LastPoster":{"Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1905112,"PostDate":1442808131,"PostContent":"You can also go to www.visitjamaica.com and click on weddings and honeymoons then 'resources'. T...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430537880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79378,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"726ac1b34ee8c8de2b6bb5760c7d01af","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Diana2501\" post=\"1900284\" timestamp=\"1436736473\"]\nHI everyone and am I so glad to have found you all :-)\n\nI am planning my wedding at the Hyatt in Montego Bay after visiting quite a few resorts in June to make a decision.  Decided on the Hyatt but now researching florists and photographers because the onsite one is expensive for what you get.  I have to pay a vendor fee so hopefully it will still work out cheaper to bring someone in to film and decorate the venue.  If I had a photographer in my wedding party that would have been ideal.\n\nI look forward to reading the other posts and to receive any advice, recommendations with the planning process and if anyone knows or can recommend any of these, I would be grateful.\n\nSorry if this is a repeat request, but I will stat to read through the posts incase someone has already posted these recently.\n\nHappy planning everyone and congratulations xx\n\nDiana\n\n :)[\/quote]You can also go to www.visitjamaica.com and click on weddings and honeymoons then &#039;resources&#039;. They have a list of vendors you can check out as well. I love Jamaica. I got married in Negril.","Attachments":[],"Id":1905112,"PostDate":1442808131,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Diana2501, on 12 July 2015 - 02:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>HI everyone and am I so glad to have found you all :-)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am planning my wedding at the Hyatt in Montego Bay after visiting quite a few resorts in June to make a decision. \u00a0Decided on the Hyatt but now researching florists and photographers because the onsite one is expensive for what you get. \u00a0I have to pay a vendor fee so hopefully it will still work out cheaper to bring someone in to film and decorate the venue. \u00a0If I had a photographer in my wedding party that would have been ideal.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I look forward to reading the other posts and to receive any advice, recommendations with the planning process and if anyone knows or can recommend any of these, I would be grateful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry if this is a repeat request, but I will stat to read through the posts incase someone has already posted these recently.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning everyone and congratulations xx<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Diana<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>You can also go to www.visitjamaica.com and click on weddings and honeymoons then 'resources'. They have a list of vendors you can check out as well. I love Jamaica. I got married in Negril.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430537880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79378","Title":"Newbie Planning A June 2016 Wedding In Jamaica","LastPostDate":1442808131},"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
