{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":121000,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"jacquewedding,\n\n1weddingirl has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"TA\".\n\n1weddingirl said:\n======================================================================\nYou're welcome and good luck. Let me know how it goes!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11561&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1443808716,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11561},{"Id":119387,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"jacquewedding,\n\n1weddingirl has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"TA\".\n\n1weddingirl said:\n======================================================================\nHi!\n \nMy agent was Niyoka at Vacation Your Way: 1-888-221-4470. She is excellent with emails too so you can also email her at info@vacationyourway.ca!\n \nI hope she works out for you and if she doesn't, I hope you find a great TA soon. It and finding the resort were the toughest part of the whole process.\n \nHappy planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=11561&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1443204476,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11561},{"Id":118571,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"jacquewedding,\n\ndeecol has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Total Advantage Travel & Tours\".\n\ndeecol said:\n======================================================================\nHi!\n\nI used Total Advantage Travel & Tours\n(416) 240-7700\n\nMy direct TA is Karina, but I've email communications with Johnny & Robert as well.  If you call the direct line looking for a quote anyone there can help you.\n\nGood Luck!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=11536#msg20579\n","Sender":{"Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1443808962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442937983,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":11536},{"Id":118164,"Title":"liked a post you made in Accidentally Bought My Dres...","Message":"Hello!\n\nmaybeoneday just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThank you @calgarybride2015 (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/) . Here is the one I end up buying. The dress is so much nicer than this picture. \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79600-accidentally-bought-my-dress-but-i-love-it\/?view=findpost&p=1905063\n","Sender":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1442770904,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":118161,"Title":"liked a post you made in Accidentally Bought My Dres...","Message":"Hello!\n\nFutureMrsGlover just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThank you @calgarybride2015 (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/) . Here is the one I end up buying. The dress is so much nicer than this picture. \n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79600-accidentally-bought-my-dress-but-i-love-it\/?view=findpost&p=1905063\n","Sender":{"Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442770610,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":118123,"Title":"liked a post you made in Accidentally Bought My Dres...","Message":"Hello!\n\nvancouverpetunia just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nThey say dont ever go to bridal shop and try on dresses until you are ready to buy one because most likely you will end up liking the one you tried on.  I went to this Toronto Designer warehouse sale just to checked it as they are advertising thousands of designer dresses at really good steal. Th...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79600-accidentally-bought-my-dress-but-i-love-it\/?view=findpost&p=1905040\n","Sender":{"Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1442685852,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":112386,"Title":"approved your friend request","Message":"jacquewedding,\n\nperianjay has approved your friend request!\n\nLog in and then manage your friends: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=profile&section=friends&do=list\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1440751145,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Profile","RelatedItemId":281478},{"Id":105003,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that TinkerSofi mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79440-too-early-to-plan\/?view=findpost&p=1901598\n\n----------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nhow old are you ?\n \ni'm man and 26 age\n \ncan i marrige now ?\n-----------------------------\n\nI'm trying to understand this post. Is it a joke? what's going on!? hahah\n \nUsually the place to look for love is among other single people. A wedding website might not be the best approach. \n \n@\"jacquewedding\" you have plenty of time. I know it feels overwhelming right now, but as long as you do little things along the way you'll be ok and you'll get to your wedding day with very little stress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>. Once you choose and book your resort things start falling into place and that's were the fun part begins <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. \n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438258205,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":104203,"Title":"liked a post you made in Too Early To Plan","Message":"Hello!\n\nperianjay just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHello everyone I recently joined BDW and Im glad I did as this site is a great help already.  My planned wedding date is April 2017. I just need some advice if I should start getting a travel agent or booking my wedding date at the resort?  Is it too early?\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79440-too-early-to-plan\/?view=findpost&p=1901340\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1438089746,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":100673,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"jacquewedding,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome jacquewedding to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello jacquewedding,\n\nWelcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.    \n\nHere are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.     \n\n  If you have not done so, you may want to:     \ncomplete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)\nvisit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself  \nStart your own wedding planning blog  \nfind the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in\n \n  Here are some links that may be helpful to you:     \nDestination Wedding Community & Forum  \nResort Reviews  \nWedding Vendor Reviews  \nDestination Wedding Tips and Articles  \nWedding Image Gallery  \nBDW Help Page  \nBDW Forum Rules and Etiquette  \nHow to Download Attachments  \n \n  Here are some BDW members and staff you should follow:     \n\nModerators and Community Leaders     \nTammy Host - Founder and Owner of BDW  .  Tammy got married at Dreams Los Cabos in 2006\nAlexisinJamaica   - Moderator & Community Leader. Alexis got married in Jamaica in 2013.\n \nIf you would like to \"like\" or \"follow\" us, here are our BDW accounts:   \nBDW on Facebook   \nBDW on Twitter   \nBDW on Pinterest   \n \n  If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,   please email advertise@bestdestinationwedding.com .   \n\n Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!      \n\nPlease feel free to browse around and get to know others. If you have any questions please don't hesitate to ask. Hope you enjoy your time here.    \n\nTeam BDW    \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=10584#msg19158\n","Sender":{"Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1436806873,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10584}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"10","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
