> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.68.109.248","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f8e4999aba04180e4ffe93311610f227","RawContent":"Now, our wedding is less than 8 months away, I feel I&#039;m now on countdown. I ordered my dress. However, I&#039;m Still wondering if we should use the resort photographer or hire an outside photographer? Want to do a Trash the Dress shoot, pre-ceremony and evening activities pictures. I&#039;m wondering if the resort photographer will stay with me all afternoon to the evening hours?\n\n\nWhat is everyone else doing right now?","Attachments":[],"Id":1891108,"PostDate":1427517522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Now, our wedding is less than 8 months away, I feel I'm now on countdown. I ordered my dress. However, I'm Still wondering if we should use the resort photographer or hire an outside photographer? Want to do a Trash the Dress shoot, pre-ceremony and evening activities pictures. I'm wondering if the resort photographer will stay with me all afternoon to the evening hours?<br><br>\nWhat is everyone else doing right now?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f860c82fed39ef6c6c5f4b02741d1074","RawContent":"[quote name=\"RandL2015\" post=\"1891108\" timestamp=\"1427531922\"]\nNow, our wedding is less than 8 months away, I feel I&#039;m now on countdown. I ordered my dress. However, I&#039;m Still wondering if we should use the resort photographer or hire an outside photographer? Want to do a Trash the Dress shoot, pre-ceremony and evening activities pictures. I&#039;m wondering if the resort photographer will stay with me all afternoon to the evening hours?\n\nWhat is everyone else doing right now?[\/quote]\nAny photographer will stay with you all day if you pay them :) we had an 8 hour package.  Good luck choosing. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891118,"PostDate":1427542281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>RandL2015, on 28 March 2015 - 04:38 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Now, our wedding is less than 8 months away, I feel I'm now on countdown. I ordered my dress. However, I'm Still wondering if we should use the resort photographer or hire an outside photographer? Want to do a Trash the Dress shoot, pre-ceremony and evening activities pictures. I'm wondering if the resort photographer will stay with me all afternoon to the evening hours?<br><br>\nWhat is everyone else doing right now?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nAny photographer will stay with you all day if you pay them <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> we had an 8 hour package.  Good luck choosing. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.68.109.248","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed199bd2f8d6c2554e045eca850148d2","RawContent":"I know right!! Lol!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1891124,"PostDate":1427553044,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know right!! Lol!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.73.7.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02111ce2fbd69217e4c8649dff0b57d8","RawContent":"Coming down the stretch in the final 3 months countdown. Now, I have purchased my wedding invitations, (doing boarding passes), and just waiting for the final product to arrive. My hope is to mail them out by August 15th. \n\n\nAlso, purchaed my Bridal Entourage gifts: Monogram tote bag, flip flops, Kimono robe, and a Personalized shot glass.\n\nFor the men: Monogram Backpack, shoes for the wedding and beach, and Ear Phones\n\n\nThere are  A LOT of guests NOT coming to the wedding b\/c of various reasons. Now, since our wedding will be on Thanksgiving afternoon, and almost all of the families who are not going to the wedding will be together anyway for dinner,  they want us to Skype the wedding. I decided not to Skype the actual wedding ceremony, but maybe Skype during the reception.\n\n\nWhat are my other fellow November Brides doing now?","Attachments":[],"Id":1901666,"PostDate":1438413920,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Coming down the stretch in the final 3 months countdown. Now, I have purchased my wedding invitations, (doing boarding passes), and just waiting for the final product to arrive. My hope is to mail them out by August 15th. <br><br>\nAlso, purchaed my Bridal Entourage gifts: Monogram tote bag, flip flops, Kimono robe, and a Personalized shot glass.<br>\nFor the men: Monogram Backpack, shoes for the wedding and beach, and Ear Phones<br><br>\nThere are  A LOT of guests NOT coming to the wedding b\/c of various reasons. Now, since our wedding will be on Thanksgiving afternoon, and almost all of the families who are not going to the wedding will be together anyway for dinner,  they want us to Skype the wedding. I decided not to Skype the actual wedding ceremony, but maybe Skype during the reception.<br><br>\nWhat are my other fellow November Brides doing now?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.191.35.221","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7992a68662d02e9d9fa116ef44d44853","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats to all you beautiful brides!!! I just got engaged and can&#039;t figure out a month to get married in Mexico. I was also thinking November 2016. Something after July. Any suggestions?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902075,"PostDate":1438942431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats to all you beautiful brides!!! I just got engaged and can't figure out a month to get married in Mexico. I was also thinking November 2016. Something after July. Any suggestions?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephanie.varias@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.191.35.221","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438692152,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"stephanienicole","Id":284272,"Name":"stephanienicole","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"710ff24329ab2cda9385930d0f242792","RawContent":"[quote name=\"stephanienicole\" post=\"1902075\" timestamp=\"1438956831\"]\nCongrats to all you beautiful brides!!! I just got engaged and can&#039;t figure out a month to get married in Mexico. I was also thinking November 2016. Something after July. Any suggestions?[\/quote]@[member=\"stephanienicole\"], I have responded to you r pm,\n\ntop 3 months that \nFebruary\nMay \nNovember","Attachments":[],"Id":1902084,"PostDate":1438946680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>stephanienicole, on 07 August 2015 - 10:13 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Congrats to all you beautiful brides!!! I just got engaged and can't figure out a month to get married in Mexico. I was also thinking November 2016. Something after July. Any suggestions?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284272\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284272-stephanienicole\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">stephanienicole<\/span><\/a>, I have responded to you r pm,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>top 3 months that\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>February<\/p>\n<p>May\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>November<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection!<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html'>http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(40,40,40)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'>Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.75.116.50","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ceaa3ba9e6ffa9e9ec646ae1d25e5987","RawContent":"Had a GREAT weekend!! My friends planned a surprise spa getaway weekend. They just told me to have a weekend bag together and include a swimsuit. Also to be ready at 9:00am the next day. Next thing I know, we are at a spa resort hotel getting a full body massage. Loved it!! \n\n\nNow, back to wedding planning.  Lol. I have been very busy.\n\nJust sent out my invitations.\n\n\nAlso, finished my Bridal Entourage gifts: tote bag, kimono robe, purple clutch purse with Jo Malone sample perfumes, wet bikini bag, shot glass, and flip flops.\n\n\n\n\nFinished my centerpieces. \n\n\nStill waiting for people to RSVP and pay for their rooms...so frustrating!!\n\n\nWhat are my other November brides doing?","Attachments":[{"Id":33584,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-86446200-1441104083.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-86446200-1441104083_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":747}],"Id":1903849,"PostDate":1441090469,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Had a GREAT weekend!! My friends planned a surprise spa getaway weekend. They just told me to have a weekend bag together and include a swimsuit. Also to be ready at 9:00am the next day. Next thing I know, we are at a spa resort hotel getting a full body massage. Loved it!! <br><br>\nNow, back to wedding planning.  Lol. I have been very busy.<br>\nJust sent out my invitations.<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1903849]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-88851200-1441103668.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  74KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-88851200-1441103668.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1903849]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-55335600-1441103694.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  84.67KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-55335600-1441103694.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1903849]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-71080000-1441103728.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  69.41KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-71080000-1441103728.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nAlso, finished my Bridal Entourage gifts: tote bag, kimono robe, purple clutch purse with Jo Malone sample perfumes, wet bikini bag, shot glass, and flip flops.<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1903849]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-34630200-1441103958.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  131.05KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-34630200-1441103958.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\nHad my dress fitting. [attachment=33584:image.jpg]<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1903849]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-78514800-1441104116.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  90.79KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-78514800-1441104116.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nFinished my centerpieces. <br><br>\nStill waiting for people to RSVP and pay for their rooms...so frustrating!!<br><br>\nWhat are my other November brides doing?<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1903849]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-31908800-1441104651.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  105.51KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2015\/post-271841-0-31908800-1441104651.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6692de376ef4505805e344d5647f6f2b","RawContent":"Everything looks awesome. You look gorgeous in your dress :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1903865,"PostDate":1441103158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Everything looks awesome. You look gorgeous in your dress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a