-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> very exciting for sure! you have lots of time to check out these boards and research info to help you plan your Perfect Big Day!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> wishing you all the best with your journey - cheers!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"215154\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215154\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"215155\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215155\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375478876765_1223\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"*&#10;\" data-id=\"215156\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215156\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbba49a3fcec2c088e363843a0710dce","RawContent":"Thank you!! Just absorbing and enjoying the process. Love the community feeling of this website.","Attachments":[],"Id":1786747,"PostDate":1375483853,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you!! Just absorbing and enjoying the process. Love the community feeling of this website.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc6503f69323b6c857995d6ea3cffd87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats RandL2015!!! - on setting your Wedding Date for Thanksgiving - wow! gives a whole new meaning to the day :) plus so easy for people to remember....all kinds of benefits - well done!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also welcome to our forum community - as you say - it has a great feeling, as well as being an excellent resource for everyone to share ideas, insights + experiences - Enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_1086\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"215286\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215286\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_1508\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"215287\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215287\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_1895\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"215288\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215288\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_2303\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"215289\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215289\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_2702\"&gt; Photography Is Forever Studios&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"215290\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215290\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1786905,"PostDate":1375541096,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats RandL2015!!! - on setting your Wedding Date for Thanksgiving - wow! gives a whole new meaning to the day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> plus so easy for people to remember....all kinds of benefits - well done!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also welcome to our forum community - as you say - it has a great feeling, as well as being an excellent resource for everyone to share ideas, insights + experiences - Enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_1086\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"215286\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215286\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_1508\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"215287\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215287\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_1895\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"215288\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215288\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_2303\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"215289\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215289\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_10_0_1_1375558654566_2702\"> Photography Is Forever Studios\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"215290\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/215290\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"contact@photographyisforever.com","IpAddress":"204.112.154.75","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1372797157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271141.png?_r=1386613206","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"photoisforever","Id":271141,"Name":"photoisforever","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1400e6fffa7a395891e67edbdb1f09c5","RawContent":"Congrats!","Attachments":[],"Id":1797036,"PostDate":1378154943,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bride@cancunwedding.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1371829364,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270816.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bridemoonpalace","Id":270816,"Name":"bridemoonpalace","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"513eccda99bd32a7ab0330bc2f43a3b4","RawContent":"I know it is 2 years away, but still just as excited. :smile159:","Attachments":[],"Id":1811219,"PostDate":1383379795,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know it is 2 years away, but still just as excited. :smile159:\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pinkiesup08@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.181.5.152","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1374599724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271841.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RandL2015","Id":271841,"Name":"RandL2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.100.40.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cec764e589cf0088b75aed2af52ae506","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats!!! I know your wedding will be beautiful.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1821249,"PostDate":1388492449,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats!!! I know your wedding will be beautiful.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">Tiarra <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">February 14th 2015 *A celebration of Love* <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);\">Isla Mujeres<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,0,128);\"><em>\"And now abide faith, hope, love, these three; but the greatest of these <i>is<\/i> love.\"<\/em><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"tiarrajones0913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.92.9.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365416634,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268317.jpg?_r=1387755717","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TiarraBeautyJ","Id":268317,"Name":"TiarraBeautyJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.62.102.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8dde6dba298fc94063e9ab75e17c9727","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats &amp;amp; happy planning :) sound like you&#039;re really ahead of the game!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1821526,"PostDate":1388657907,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats & happy planning <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> sound like you're really ahead of the game!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jareese425@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.177.5.32","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1386966432,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jareese425","Id":275617,"Name":"jareese425","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.169.43.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c197fbe7c98aa0b201013936997ab8f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats!!!! I&#039;m new to this forum and i&#039;m still deciding where to have my destination wedding. Has anyone worked with destinationweddings.com? Does anyone prefer or should I just plan my destination wedding on my own? Please help!!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- AprilRae&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869145,"PostDate":1409067636,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats!!!! I'm new to this forum and i'm still deciding where to have my destination wedding. Has anyone worked with destinationweddings.com? Does anyone prefer or should I just plan my destination wedding on my own? Please help!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- AprilRae<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aprilraec@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"172.8.146.161","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407374856,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279341.jpg?oh=f0e1ab09885b9a0c0901abfaf8de6a97&oe=54cbd23d&__gda__=1422573169_b7902439d71c7ac75b71b3d5542fbc56","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"AprilRae","Id":279341,"Name":"AprilRae","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.91.107.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":74739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a64204ecce3047cdd5f16787deb1b7b9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AprilRae\" post=\"1869145\" timestamp=\"1409082036\"]\nCongrats!!!! I&#039;m new to this forum and i&#039;m still deciding where to have my destination wedding. Has anyone worked with destinationweddings.com? Does anyone prefer or should I just plan my destination wedding on my own? Please help!!  :)\n\n- AprilRae[\/quote]I suggest you try and talk with a travel agent first. Maybe after you&#039;ve narrowed down the country\/area where you want to have it. I don&#039;t know if it has to be through destination weddings.com but I think travel agents can be very helpful in narrowing down hotels that have your \"musts\". \n\nTo narrow down the place I just searched online for how much trips are to a general area. We chose Mexico because,aside from Cuba, it seemed the most affordable and my fianc\u00e9 did not want to go to Cuba. We just thought we would have more people come if it was more affordable \n\nGood luck and happy planning! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1869189,"PostDate":1409076997,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AprilRae, on 26 August 2014 - 03:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Congrats!!!! I'm new to this forum and i'm still deciding where to have my destination wedding. Has anyone worked with destinationweddings.com? Does anyone prefer or should I just plan my destination wedding on my own? Please help!!  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\n- AprilRae<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI suggest you try and talk with a travel agent first. Maybe after you've narrowed down the country\/area where you want to have it. I don't know if it has to be through destination weddings.com but I think travel agents can be very helpful in narrowing down hotels that have your \"musts\". <br><br>\nTo narrow down the place I just searched online for how much trips are to a general area. We chose Mexico because,aside from Cuba, it seemed the most affordable and my fianc\u00e9 did not want to go to Cuba. We just thought we would have more people come if it was more affordable <br><br>\nGood luck and happy planning! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":49,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
