{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"598ea75955039f6c7362d59a5572bcc4","RawContent":"I&#039;m not from Canada, but I got my dress from there and it is very nice.","Attachments":[],"Id":360440,"PostDate":1214664338,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm not from Canada, but I got my dress from there and it is very nice.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Kerrington Danielle was born 6\/23\/09 12:31 pm 7lbs 14oz.<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i295.photobucket.com\/albums\/mm125\/2008bride\/IMG_9487.jpg\">http:\/\/i295.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...e\/IMG_9487.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"klhanx@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1198094123,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208049.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kelly C","Id":208049,"Name":"Kelly C","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcc827425c61b72d760571632e03f934","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Kerrbear&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Are the any brides from Canada that have ordered from a US website? I found a dress that i Love on the Bridal Online Store but am a little leary about ordering it...any helpful hints would be appreciated!!\n \n Thanks&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;We didn&#039;t order any dresses from the US but between us we have ordered numerous items over the past few years from a variety of different places, some via ebay and some directly from websites. I ordered mugs from discountmugs.com, paraols from orientaltrading.com, and had someone from this site send 20 pashminas, etc. etc.\n \n Sometimes we get hit with customs &amp;amp; brokerage fees and extra taxes, and sometimes we don&#039;t. There is nearly always an extra fee for shipping to Canada. Read the small print on the website very carefully. Hopefully someone else will jump in with some experience of that particular website.\n \n I think if a package comes UPS there is nearly always an extra charge, but if its sent USPS you have a better chance of not paying duty (It might be the other way around but hopefully someone else knows).","Attachments":[],"Id":360475,"PostDate":1214666361,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Kerrbear<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/441780' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Are the any brides from Canada that have ordered from a US website? I found a dress that i Love on the Bridal Online Store but am a little leary about ordering it...any helpful hints would be appreciated!!<br \/> <br \/> Thanks<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>We didn't order any dresses from the US but between us we have ordered numerous items over the past few years from a variety of different places, some via ebay and some directly from websites. I ordered mugs from discountmugs.com, paraols from orientaltrading.com, and had someone from this site send 20 pashminas, etc. etc.<br \/> <br \/> Sometimes we get hit with customs & brokerage fees and extra taxes, and sometimes we don't. There is nearly always an extra fee for shipping to Canada. Read the small print on the website very carefully. Hopefully someone else will jump in with some experience of that particular website.<br \/> <br \/> I think if a package comes UPS there is nearly always an extra charge, but if its sent USPS you have a better chance of not paying duty (It might be the other way around but hopefully someone else knows).\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"helen_s81@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.157.125.20","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1194744834,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207919.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":224,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Helen_S81","Id":207919,"Name":"Helen_S81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d2e41d900add56fbaa287ed43ed4286","RawContent":"has anyone ordered from lee philip? they were the best price for a BM dress I&#039;m ordering.","Attachments":[],"Id":531979,"PostDate":1229016321,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                has anyone ordered from lee philip? they were the best price for a BM dress I'm ordering.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morganleigh03@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.177.182.183","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1182650580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rodent","Id":207489,"Name":"rodent","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc08b9e3cc69957a009a0f0ca072347d","RawContent":"I recently order my wedding dress from bridalonlinestore and is FANTASTIC. I lost my first dress to a house fire so I had to get it shipped ASAP and they came through for me.....I even like it way better than my first dress! AND I live in Canada. They also gave me a free matching hand bag and a shawl that was a complete surprise because it didn&#039;t say it was included. AWESOME experience.","Attachments":[],"Id":538956,"PostDate":1229834235,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I recently order my wedding dress from bridalonlinestore and is FANTASTIC. I lost my first dress to a house fire so I had to get it shipped ASAP and they came through for me.....I even like it way better than my first dress! AND I live in Canada. They also gave me a free matching hand bag and a shawl that was a complete surprise because it didn't say it was included. AWESOME experience.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;60\/st\/20090115\/e\/Our+Wedding+%21%21\/dt\/-3\/k\/14d8\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...14d8\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"seahagamy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1205891537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208850.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":72,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Seahagamy","Id":208850,"Name":"Seahagamy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb1feb423b38bce6abdfbf1f8ed10a51","RawContent":"I know I&#039;m a little late, but I can say that I had a great experience with TJ Formal.\n \n Shipping was fast, they were about $40 cheaper than the boutique prices, and they didn&#039;t charge for a plus size or tax.\n \n We need to Sticky this in the Attire thread. I don&#039;t remember ever seeing it and it is, I&#039;m sure, very helpful.","Attachments":[],"Id":539021,"PostDate":1229872397,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I know I'm a little late, but I can say that I had a great experience with TJ Formal.<br \/> <br \/> Shipping was fast, they were about $40 cheaper than the boutique prices, and they didn't charge for a plus size or tax.<br \/> <br \/> We need to Sticky this in the Attire thread. I don't remember ever seeing it and it is, I'm sure, very helpful.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/blogs\/erinb\">Visit My BDW Blog!<\/a><\/strong><br><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/21100-couples-swept-away-review-insanely-long-and-detailed\/\">My CSA Wedding Review<\/a><\/strong><br><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/20334-erinbs-csa-pro-pics-better-late-than-never\/\">Wedding Pictures<\/a><\/strong> & <strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/20335-erinbs-ttd-pic-heavy\/\">My TTD<\/a><\/strong><br><strong><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/18150-erinbs-planning-thread\/\">My Planning Thread<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n","Email":"arynn2@aol.com","IpAddress":"74.138.76.73","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1196792400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208007.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":71,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ErinB","Id":208007,"Name":"ErinB","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79ccd2dca9b751d63b496202069661b4","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;cancunbride&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;HAS ANYONE ORDERED THEIR DRESS FROM HERE? I SAW ONE I ABSOLUTELY LOVE BUT IM WONDERING IF THESE ARE KNOCK OFF&#039;S?&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestbridalprices.com\"&gt;Wedding Dresses, Prom Dresses, Wedding Accessories at BestBridalPrices.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I ordered both BM dresses from there and they were great. They came from the manufacturer so it took 4 months to get. One dress came in before the other so they shipped it right away and did not charge extra to ship the other dress later. I was very pleased with the service. Shipping was only $15.00 and I save about $100 on both dresses.","Attachments":[],"Id":539341,"PostDate":1229909970,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>cancunbride<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/403007' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">HAS ANYONE ORDERED THEIR DRESS FROM HERE? I SAW ONE I ABSOLUTELY LOVE BUT IM WONDERING IF THESE ARE KNOCK OFF'S?<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/doh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Doh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestbridalprices.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Dresses, Prom Dresses, Wedding Accessories at BestBridalPrices.com<\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I ordered both BM dresses from there and they were great. They came from the manufacturer so it took 4 months to get. One dress came in before the other so they shipped it right away and did not charge extra to ship the other dress later. I was very pleased with the service. Shipping was only $15.00 and I save about $100 on both dresses.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Sylvia<\/i><br><br><strong><i>Our wedding slideshow<\/i><\/strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=1384711218&ref=name#\/video\/video.php?v=1047086342460\">http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?...=1047086342460<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"syl042215@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1216257844,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210596.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"syl1115","Id":210596,"Name":"syl1115","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1887fc2fd9132e1054d5389e71a724a","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Morgan&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I thought it would be helpful to compile the websites that sell bridal gowns &amp;amp; BM dresses for less. I had a great experience with TJ formal. I saved $100 on a BM dress. Now I am shopping for my friend&#039;s wedding dress for less. \n \n If you have used one of these companies, post what you thought &amp;amp; I&#039;ll update the first post.\n \n Lee Philip &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.leephilipbridals.com\/\"&gt;Page Title&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Netbride &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.netbride.com\/\"&gt;Netbride - discount bridal gowns, wedding gowns, bridesmaid dresses&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Perfect bridal &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.perfectbridal.com\/\"&gt;Wedding Dresses at Discount Prices&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Best bridal prices &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestbridalprices.com\/\"&gt;Wedding Dresses, Prom Dresses, Wedding Accessories at BestBridalPrices.com&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Bridal elegance &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bridalelegance-eriepa.com\/\"&gt;Bridal Elegance&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n RK bridal &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/rkbridal.com\/localpages\/new_page_1.htm\"&gt;New Page 1&lt;\/a&gt;\n toll-free: 800-929-9512 \n \n Chrissy Os &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.chrissyobridal.com\/index.htm\"&gt;Welcome to Chrissy O Fashion and Bridal Boutique!&lt;\/a&gt;\n Recommended by a knottie\n \n TJ formal &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.tjformal.com\/\"&gt;2008 Prom Dresses - Wedding Dresses - Bridemaids - Mother of the Bride Gowns&lt;\/a&gt; (google for a 10% off coupon)\n Recommended by Tami (foxytv) &amp;amp; Morgan&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I ordered my original dress from &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/ebridalsuperstore.com\"&gt;http:\/\/ebridalsuperstore.com&lt;\/a&gt;. It took 4 months to come in.","Attachments":[],"Id":539347,"PostDate":1229910568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Morgan<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/387084' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I thought it would be helpful to compile the websites that sell bridal gowns & BM dresses for less. I had a great experience with TJ formal. I saved $100 on a BM dress. Now I am shopping for my friend's wedding dress for less. <br \/> <br \/> If you have used one of these companies, post what you thought & I'll update the first post.<br \/> <br \/> Lee Philip <a href='http:\/\/www.leephilipbridals.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Page Title<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Netbride <a href='http:\/\/www.netbride.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Netbride - discount bridal gowns, wedding gowns, bridesmaid dresses<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Perfect bridal <a href='http:\/\/www.perfectbridal.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Dresses at Discount Prices<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Best bridal prices <a href='http:\/\/www.bestbridalprices.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wedding Dresses, Prom Dresses, Wedding Accessories at BestBridalPrices.com<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Bridal elegance <a href='http:\/\/www.bridalelegance-eriepa.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Bridal Elegance<\/a><br \/> <br \/> RK bridal <a href='http:\/\/rkbridal.com\/localpages\/new_page_1.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>New Page 1<\/a><br \/> toll-free: 800-929-9512 <br \/> <br \/> Chrissy Os <a href='http:\/\/www.chrissyobridal.com\/index.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Welcome to Chrissy O Fashion and Bridal Boutique!<\/a><br \/> Recommended by a knottie<br \/> <br \/> TJ formal <a href='http:\/\/www.tjformal.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>2008 Prom Dresses - Wedding Dresses - Bridemaids - Mother of the Bride Gowns<\/a> (google for a 10% off coupon)<br \/> Recommended by Tami (foxytv) & Morgan<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I ordered my original dress from <a href='http:\/\/ebridalsuperstore.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/ebridalsuperstore.com<\/a>. It took 4 months to come in.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Sylvia<\/i><br><br><strong><i>Our wedding slideshow<\/i><\/strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?id=1384711218&ref=name#\/video\/video.php?v=1047086342460\">http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/profile.php?...=1047086342460<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"syl042215@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1216257844,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210596.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"syl1115","Id":210596,"Name":"syl1115","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7effd4bf1300f54005158902dbac9da","RawContent":"I ordered my dress from bestbridalprices.com, i got it less than 10 weeks after ordering it! It was perfect, and their customer service was amazing. Plus i saved $600.00 from the instore price here in Canada. I just need to get it steamed now, but I highly recommend them!","Attachments":[],"Id":540030,"PostDate":1230002758,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I ordered my dress from bestbridalprices.com, i got it less than 10 weeks after ordering it! It was perfect, and their customer service was amazing. Plus i saved $600.00 from the instore price here in Canada. I just need to get it steamed now, but I highly recommend them!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/bYxCm7\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/bYxCm7\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cdawe@alumni.sfu.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1218151240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211051.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":85,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"edssbride09","Id":211051,"Name":"edssbride09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6bcbc9e552e6fca2ccfbe06b6190e7fe","RawContent":"i just ordered a BM dress from chrissy O&#039;s. The beat Lee Philip by 6% &amp;amp; their shipping was less. Both Chrissy O&#039;s &amp;amp; Lee Philip had excellent customer service.","Attachments":[],"Id":540041,"PostDate":1230005363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i just ordered a BM dress from chrissy O's. The beat Lee Philip by 6% & their shipping was less. Both Chrissy O's & Lee Philip had excellent customer service.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"morganleigh03@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.177.182.183","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1182650580,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rodent","Id":207489,"Name":"rodent","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"I