y<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/634918' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I recently order my wedding dress from bridalonlinestore and is FANTASTIC. I lost my first dress to a house fire so I had to get it shipped ASAP and they came through for me.....I even like it way better than my first dress! AND I live in Canada. They also gave me a free matching hand bag and a shawl that was a complete surprise because it didn't say it was included. AWESOME experience.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> My dress came from the USA and it arrived in 2.5 weeks.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;60\/st\/20090115\/e\/Our+Wedding+%21%21\/dt\/-3\/k\/14d8\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...14d8\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"seahagamy@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1205891537,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-208850.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":72,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Seahagamy","Id":208850,"Name":"Seahagamy","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":62,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
