 class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Ever After Formal Wear Inc User Reviews - Orlando, FL 32837 - Citysearch<\/a><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>That's it, thank you sooooooo much!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly.beaudry@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1232983409,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214320.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chloe55","Id":214320,"Name":"chloe55","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bc7b53ab4fbd4f6761f6b8c2716f294","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;montegobay09&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I just ran into this thread now and thought I&#039;d add how I saved $$ on my dress. I was looking for something appropriate for the beach and I wanted to be practical and get a dress that wasn&#039;t too heavy. Even destination wedding gowns seemed to have too much material. I ended up ordering a bridesmaid&#039;s dress in white and it&#039;s perfect!! and I saved sooooo much money because it&#039;s not a &amp;quot;wedding gown&amp;quot;. I only paid $199&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I also felt that the dresses I was seeing were to big and heavy too.\n I found three dresses that I liked and they were all bridesmaids dresses and more than half the price off the original dress I wanted! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile29\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":694118,"PostDate":1242525809,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>montegobay09<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/693443' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I just ran into this thread now and thought I'd add how I saved $$ on my dress. I was looking for something appropriate for the beach and I wanted to be practical and get a dress that wasn't too heavy. Even destination wedding gowns seemed to have too much material. I ended up ordering a bridesmaid's dress in white and it's perfect!! and I saved sooooo much money because it's not a \"wedding gown\". I only paid $199<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I also felt that the dresses I was seeing were to big and heavy too.<br \/> I found three dresses that I liked and they were all bridesmaids dresses and more than half the price off the original dress I wanted! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile29\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Rosa<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10743;6\/st\/20091110\/e\/we+FINALLY+get+married%21%21%21\/k\/61cc\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...61cc\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"rar_122201@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1235927897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215355.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EDSROSA","Id":215355,"Name":"EDSROSA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f96a8cf8bbb4b926019502b5ce3b3812","RawContent":"&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\/Product\/Pro2654.html\"&gt;wedding dress (HS1583)-wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal&lt;\/a&gt; - I wish it said what the original dress was. I really like this one! Thanks ladies for all the reviews!","Attachments":[],"Id":694405,"PostDate":1242584060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a href='http:\/\/www.landybridal.com\/Product\/Pro2654.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>wedding dress (HS1583)-wedding dress,prom gown and bridesmaid dress by landy bridal<\/a> - I wish it said what the original dress was. I really like this one! Thanks ladies for all the reviews!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meghan.havill@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1238089405,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216180.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pvbeachbride10","Id":216180,"Name":"pvbeachbride10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16523,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4ae96573a0919dda8350ec82314599f","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;JCrosby&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Has anyone heard of weddingdressmart.com? They have tons of Maggie Sottero dresses for $350! And the shipping is free...even to Canada. It seems too good to be true...maybe they&#039;re knock offs?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Did you happen to ever order from weddingdressmart.com&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;\n \n The dresses are so cheap and they accept refunds! They HAVE to be knock offs...","Attachments":[],"Id":744790,"PostDate":1246477143,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>JCrosby<\/strong> <a href='\/forum\/post\/693279' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span><\/a>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Has anyone heard of weddingdressmart.com? They have tons of Maggie Sottero dresses for $350! And the shipping is free...even to Canada. It seems too good to be true...maybe they're knock offs?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Did you happen to ever order from weddingdressmart.com<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The dresses are so cheap and they accept refunds! They HAVE to be knock offs...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-cl