owEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.124.40.102","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c59cc5dda0c60c0e0a3e42244bf9ac70","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am walking down the aisle with our song. You by Switchfoot&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=qYAAAr5-qkw&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883858,"PostDate":1422026876,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am walking down the aisle with our song. You by Switchfoot<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/qYAAAr5-qkw?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blushingbride1988@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.124.40.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416236693,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"blushingbride19","Id":281186,"Name":"blushingbride19","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.139.45.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9511d9a41e560e124075a0048e3a3cf9","RawContent":"I wanted to tribute some music to my grandparents who raised me listening to Elvis and Johnny Cash. They are not here to be at our wedding. It&#039;s my own way to honor them. \n\n\nPre ceremony music is going to go from 50&#039;s to current.\n\n\nElvis - can&#039;t help but falling in love\n\nJohnny cash - walk the line\n\nRighteous brothers - unchained melody\n\nElton john- your song\n\nPeter Gabriel - your eyes\n\nMazzy Star - fade into you\n\nFiest- Brandy Alexander\n\n\nThen music will increase and my children will walk down to \n\n\nThe Killers - Shot at the night \n\n\nI will walk to The Killers - Dustland fairytale \n\n\nNow to plan cocktail music!","Attachments":[],"Id":1884843,"PostDate":1422793689,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I wanted to tribute some music to my grandparents who raised me listening to Elvis and Johnny Cash. They are not here to be at our wedding. It's my own way to honor them. <br><br>\nPre ceremony music is going to go from 50's to current.<br><br>\nElvis - can't help but falling in love<br>\nJohnny cash - walk the line<br>\nRighteous brothers - unchained melody<br>\nElton john- your song<br>\nPeter Gabriel - your eyes<br>\nMazzy Star - fade into you<br>\nFiest- Brandy Alexander<br><br>\nThen music will increase and my children will walk down to <br><br>\nThe Killers - Shot at the night <br><br>\nI will walk to The Killers - Dustland fairytale <br><br>\nNow to plan cocktail music! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401122033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.245.192.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8bdefdbeb2ccd3350d011b48c13bc363","RawContent":"I love all these suggestions. How are you queuing your music I have no idea how long my walk will be they told me to bring it on an iPod and there would be a guy to hit play.  ... How did everyone know what length to do? They said 3 songs for while guests wait. Bridal party entrance, bride entrance and a song when we leave. Just not sure  how to make this run smooth. Cause clearly the songs will not play in full .... I would love to hear what all you beUties are doing?","Attachments":[],"Id":1886102,"PostDate":1423678317,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love all these suggestions. How are you queuing your music I have no idea how long my walk will be they told me to bring it on an iPod and there would be a guy to hit play.  ... How did everyone know what length to do? They said 3 songs for while guests wait. Bridal party entrance, bride entrance and a song when we leave. Just not sure  how to make this run smooth. Cause clearly the songs will not play in full .... I would love to hear what all you beUties are doing? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78846-steelethespotlights-planning-thread-may-152015-hard-rock-vallara\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78846-steelethespotlights-planning-thread-may-152015-hard-rock-vallara\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\n\u00a0","Email":"keegan.steele@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.134.151.211","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423275359,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282025.jpg?_r=1423455490","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SteeleTheSpotlight","Id":282025,"Name":"SteeleTheSpotlight","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29a4e3a2fbfb3c9d282a9e9f028fe200","RawContent":"[quote name=\"SteeleTheSpotlight\" post=\"1886102\" timestamp=\"1423692717\"]\nI love all these suggestions. How are you queuing your music I have no idea how long my walk will be they told me to bring it on an iPod and there would be a guy to hit play.  ... How did everyone know what length to do? They said 3 songs for while guests wait. Bridal party entrance, bride entrance and a song when we leave. Just not sure  how to make this run smooth. Cause clearly the songs will not play in full .... I would love to hear what all you beUties are doing?[\/quote]Our resort had a sound system they played it thru. I just had to tell them the songs and they would fade out so the next could start. I didn&#039;t have to provide anything on iPod though.  I assume the WC and the DJ were communicating so he knew how large the bridal party was to know when the music could end?? Hahaha it wasn&#039;t their first wedding so they knew what to do. \n\nMaybe email your WC to ask how they execute it?\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886115,"PostDate":1423691039,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>SteeleTheSpotlight, on 11 February 2015 - 06:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I love all these suggestions. How are you queuing your music I have no idea how long my walk will be they told me to bring it on an iPod and there would be a guy to hit play.  ... How did everyone know what length to do? They said 3 songs for while guests wait. Bridal party entrance, bride entrance and a song when we leave. Just not sure  how to make this run smooth. Cause clearly the songs will not play in full .... I would love to hear what all you beUties are doing?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nOur resort had a sound system they played it thru. I just had to tell them the songs and they would fade out so the next could start. I didn't have to provide anything on iPod though.  I assume the WC and the DJ were communicating so he knew how large the bridal party was to know when the music could end?? Hahaha it wasn't their first wedding so they knew what to do. <br><br>\nMaybe email your WC to ask how they execute it?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93f445984448372d0ceb0df6caf9de24","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Processional - Jack Johnson - Better together&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Walking down to Israel Kamakawiwo&#039;s - Somewhere over the Rainbow\/wonderful world&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Recessional&amp;nbsp;- One Republic - Good life (starting once we kiss and the 00:52 mark of the song)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886218,"PostDate":1423759431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Processional - Jack Johnson - Better together<\/p>\n<p>Walking down to Israel Kamakawiwo's - Somewhere over the Rainbow\/wonderful world<\/p>\n<p>Recessional\u00a0- One Republic - Good life (starting once we kiss and the 00:52 mark of the song)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ecdd93dd157181a7382c75bd01692a7d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;\"Just the Way You Are\" Bruno Mars   string quartet version :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=MpqJjasrD7I&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888027,"PostDate":1425311000,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>\"Just the Way You Are\" Bruno Mars\u00a0\u00a0 string quartet version <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/MpqJjasrD7I?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424099850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e08ec4ed9e7c3ae2680c509aebd04f45","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I found a song last week and I&#039;m almost certain it&#039;s what I want to use. It&#039;s The Book of Love by Peter Gabriel. I love it, and it&#039;s just what I was looking for.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888032,"PostDate":1425313587,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I found a song last week and I'm almost certain it's what I want to use. It's The Book of Love by Peter Gabriel. I love it, and it's just what I was looking for.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a8e9c132a11c4aad93ca6a606a8781a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=NvryolGa19A&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=NvryolGa19A&lt;\/a&gt;Such great ideas.&amp;nbsp; We are both big music lovers so this is like so much pressure to pick the right songs.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I thought it would be cool to walk down the aisle to the soundtrack of the movie amelie:&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888292,"PostDate":1425470027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><a href='https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=NvryolGa19A' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.youtube....h?v=NvryolGa19A<\/a>Such great ideas.\u00a0 We are both big music lovers so this is like so much pressure to pick the right songs.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I thought it would be cool to walk down the aisle to the soundtrack of the movie amelie:<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396968452,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.47.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6f06294cf3c2db68d9865b558ce4904","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1888032\" timestamp=\"1425327987\"]\nI found a song last week and I&#039;m almost certain it&#039;s what I want to use. It&#039;s The Book of Love by Peter Gabriel. I love it, and it&#039;s just what I was looking for.[\/quote]love that song","Attachments":[],"Id":1889459,"PostDate":1426519290,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 02 March 2015 - 04:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I found a song last week and I'm almost certain it's what I want to use. It's The Book of Love by Peter Gabriel. I love it, and it's just what I was looking for.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>love that song<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78914-meandhim-grand-palladium-bavaro-nov-2015\/'>My Planning Thread<\/a>\u00a0- MeandHim - Grand Palladium Bavaro - Nov 25 2015<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;116\/st\/20151125\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/461e\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"markandshavonne@live.com","IpAddress":"70.30.85.211","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1365777659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268499.jpg?_r=1395417550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Meandhim","Id":268499,"Name":"Meandhim","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"27267","Title":"What are you walking down the Aisle to?","LastPostDate":1426519290},"Pages":{"TotalItems":999,"TotalPages":100,"CurrentPage":990,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":980,"LastPage":990},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
