{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"111.93.186.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1049ce9ee5affb74d03e8754c058667c","RawContent":"&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Well I chose to play \"Turning Page by Sleeping at Last\" played in Breaking dawn in wedding of Bella and Edward. Since then I wanted to play &amp;nbsp;this on my wedding . I was happy when it happened. Just go with your heat, NO hard and fast rules!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882087,"PostDate":1420600084,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \n\t<span  style=\"color:#000000\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Well I chose to play \"Turning Page by Sleeping at Last\" played in Breaking dawn in wedding of Bella and Edward. Since then I wanted to play \u00a0this on my wedding . I was happy when it happened. Just go with your heat, NO hard and fast rules!<\/span><\/span><\/span>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"skashish033@gmail.com","IpAddress":"111.93.186.158","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407217968,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MillerK","Id":279306,"Name":"MillerK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cee18550c8158231281bf7a030572596","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Handel - Water music - Air&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882146,"PostDate":1420646470,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Handel - Water music - Air<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391606556,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.15.193.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ada614ed24cb3a5a0e4f92e7c2ca7fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are getting married in Cabo in July. We had to choose a Bridal Party Entrance, Bride&#039;s Entrance, and Recessional songs to play on a CD. I think I am going to go with...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1- Train- Marry me&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2-  Chantal Kreviazuk- It feels like home&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3- Israel Kamakawiwo- Somewhere over the rainbow&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is my question... are you supposed to play the instrumental versions only or do you play the songs with the actual lyrics during the ceremony? Not sure if it could go either way. I wanted to see what most brides are doing! Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882256,"PostDate":1420734895,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are getting married in Cabo in July. We had to choose a Bridal Party Entrance, Bride's Entrance, and Recessional songs to play on a CD. I think I am going to go with...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1- Train- Marry me<\/p>\n<p>2-\u00a0\u00a0Chantal Kreviazuk- It feels like home<\/p>\n<p>3- Israel Kamakawiwo- Somewhere over the rainbow<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is my question... are you supposed to play the instrumental versions only or do you play the songs with the actual lyrics during the ceremony? Not sure if it could go either way. I wanted to see what most brides are doing! Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenna32schap@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.97.32.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394372700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277065.jpg?_r=1438546602","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenna32schap","Id":277065,"Name":"jenna32schap","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"648030e3815b77c466006af8ebf5466f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jenna32schap\" post=\"1882256\" timestamp=\"1420749295\"]\nWe are getting married in Cabo in July. We had to choose a Bridal Party Entrance, Bride&#039;s Entrance, and Recessional songs to play on a CD. I think I am going to go with...\n\n1- Train- Marry me\n2-  Chantal Kreviazuk- It feels like home\n3- Israel Kamakawiwo- Somewhere over the rainbow\n\nHere is my question... are you supposed to play the instrumental versions only or do you play the songs with the actual lyrics during the ceremony? Not sure if it could go either way. I wanted to see what most brides are doing! Thank you![\/quote]Whatever you like :). The only song I am\nusing in instrumental is my song!\n\nBridal party - marry me by train\nMy entrance - 1000 years in instrumental by piano guys\nSigning - truly madly deeply by savage garden \nExit - on top of the world by imagine dragons. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1882279,"PostDate":1420748471,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jenna32schap, on 08 January 2015 - 04:34 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>We are getting married in Cabo in July. We had to choose a Bridal Party Entrance, Bride's Entrance, and Recessional songs to play on a CD. I think I am going to go with...<br><br>\n1- Train- Marry me<br>\n2-  Chantal Kreviazuk- It feels like home<br>\n3- Israel Kamakawiwo- Somewhere over the rainbow<br><br>\nHere is my question... are you supposed to play the instrumental versions only or do you play the songs with the actual lyrics during the ceremony? Not sure if it could go either way. I wanted to see what most brides are doing! Thank you!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWhatever you like <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. The only song I am<br>\nusing in instrumental is my song!<br><br>\nBridal party - marry me by train<br>\nMy entrance - 1000 years in instrumental by piano guys<br>\nSigning - truly madly deeply by savage garden <br>\nExit - on top of the world by imagine dragons. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.194.5.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c3ecd686cdf823a2388bb7659c08097","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jenna32schap\" post=\"1882256\" timestamp=\"1420749295\"]\nWe are getting married in Cabo in July. We had to choose a Bridal Party Entrance, Bride&#039;s Entrance, and Recessional songs to play on a CD. I think I am going to go with...\n\n1- Train- Marry me\n2-  Chantal Kreviazuk- It feels like home\n3- Israel Kamakawiwo- Somewhere over the rainbow\n\nHere is my question... are you supposed to play the instrumental versions only or do you play the songs with the actual lyrics during the ceremony? Not sure if it could go either way. I wanted to see what most brides are doing! Thank you![\/quote]\n I used all instrumental music but that was just my preference and just thought it was more romantic.\n\nBridal party entrance - 1,000 years by the piano guys\nBride entrance - Kissing you by Des&#039;Ree (Romeo and Juliet)\nI do&#039;s\/kissing - Somewhere over the rainbow by the piano guys\nBride\/Bridal Party exit - Marry you by Bruno Mars","Attachments":[],"Id":1882334,"PostDate":1420764336,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jenna32schap, on 08 January 2015 - 04:34 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>We are getting married in Cabo in July. We had to choose a Bridal Party Entrance, Bride's Entrance, and Recessional songs to play on a CD. I think I am going to go with...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1- Train- Marry me<\/p>\n<p>2-\u00a0\u00a0Chantal Kreviazuk- It feels like home<\/p>\n<p>3- Israel Kamakawiwo- Somewhere over the rainbow<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is my question... are you supposed to play the instrumental versions only or do you play the songs with the actual lyrics during the ceremony? Not sure if it could go either way. I wanted to see what most brides are doing! Thank you!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0I used all instrumental music but that was just my preference and just thought it was more romantic.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Bridal party entrance - 1,000 years by the piano guys<\/p>\n<p>Bride entrance - Kissing you by Des'Ree (Romeo and Juliet)<\/p>\n<p>I do's\/kissing - Somewhere over the rainbow by the piano guys<\/p>\n<p>Bride\/Bridal Party exit - Marry you by Bruno Mars<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.15.193.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6c53f54d24a9694c675d26b754783e3f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] @[member=\"NJBride2014\"] Thank you both sooo much for the advice! Great song choices as well! Glad to see it could go either way!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882449,"PostDate":1420839549,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"264077\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/264077-njbride2014\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NJBride2014<\/span><\/a> Thank you both sooo much for the advice! Great song choices as well! Glad to see it could go either way!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenna32schap@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.97.32.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394372700,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277065.jpg?_r=1438546602","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenna32schap","Id":277065,"Name":"jenna32schap","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1421169841,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91e840edfd3d04cee18f9cd524ea010b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m thinking Canon in D for the bridal party and I Choose You by Sara Bareilles for me.&amp;nbsp; Our first dance will likely be&amp;nbsp;Thinking Out Loud by Ed Sheeran.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I haven&#039;t really pinned down the other songs, but you guys all have such great options.&amp;nbsp; I love this thread!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882752,"PostDate":1421169733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm thinking Canon in D for the bridal party and I Choose You by Sara Bareilles for me.\u00a0 Our first dance will likely be\u00a0Thinking Out Loud by Ed Sheeran.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I haven't really pinned down the other songs, but you guys all have such great options.\u00a0 I love this thread!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenique.brown@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411557695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JJCB0418","Id":279978,"Name":"JJCB0418","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"169.145.3.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2eecd1d01da3da4c4515a0b1b7213115","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have a guitarist who will be playing for the ceremony, so I went with Cannon in D for the Bridal party and Here Comes the Bride for me...sort of boring, but I just fell in love with the acoustic version of both songs.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882757,"PostDate":1421171654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have a guitarist who will be playing for the ceremony, so I went with Cannon in D for the Bridal party and Here Comes the Bride for me...sort of boring, but I just fell in love with the acoustic version of both songs.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michelle_tornay@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.168.63.163","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1405995005,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279117.jpg?_r=1409851926","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MichelleT","Id":279117,"Name":"MichelleT","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.107.115.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":27267,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1421268482,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ace72c61a9f5908e04a4357cbac737c6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ee82ee;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"&gt;I suggest this song \" Big Wedding Day\" It&#039;s beautiful!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=votXvevMDpY&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=votXvevMDpY&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[media]https&#58;\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=votXvevMDpY[\/media]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882944,"PostDate":1421268414,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><strong><span  style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif\">I suggest this song \" Big Wedding Day\" It's beautiful!<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=votXvevMDpY' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.youtube....h?v=votXvevMDpY<\/a><\/p>\n<p><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/votXvevMDpY?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"juliafsteinberg@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.107.115.130","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421268263,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281729.jpg?_r=1421678961","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"LoveJbug","Id":281729,"Name":"LoveJbug","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.5.209.133","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":fa