{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":13,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1027,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1877022,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":280393,"Name":"rmfowler09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280393.jpg?_r=1414135304","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1414380633,"LastPoster":{"Id":281186,"Name":"blushingbride19","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":45,"Preview":{"Id":1879321,"PostDate":1417282405,"PostContent":"I would definitely keep in mind that weddings are supposed to be fun and many guests do like to d...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blushingbride1988@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.124.40.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416236693,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"blushingbride19","Id":281186,"Name":"blushingbride19","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.105.237.147","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78294,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35c9a5506757ed2014e929e07cb534b3","RawContent":"Well I just went on vacation to punta cana and was able to visit the resort we are getting married at (which was very exciting!). We were able to take a tour and were shown the area of the beach the reception would be. The area actually has more packed down\/hard sand so there would be no problem dancing. The wedding coordinator said those who want a more laid back\/barefoot wedding often opt for no dance floor there and there are no problems with dancing! Getting excited!","Attachments":[],"Id":1878063,"PostDate":1415556364,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Well I just went on vacation to punta cana and was able to visit the resort we are getting married at (which was very exciting!). We were able to take a tour and were shown the area of the beach the reception would be. The area actually has more packed down\/hard sand so there would be no problem dancing. The wedding coordinator said those who want a more laid back\/barefoot wedding often opt for no dance floor there and there are no problems with dancing! Getting excited! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rmfowler09@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.124.119.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412782910,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280393.jpg?_r=1414135304","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rmfowler09","Id":280393,"Name":"rmfowler09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78294,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ad279d29d26b07a9b565379942d3bc6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jeffandrobyn\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know!&amp;nbsp; But we are not actually hiring a dj.&amp;nbsp; The FI is a dj\/music producer so he&#039;s going to set up a premixed set and one of his close friends is also a dj so he can step in if need be.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If we hired an outside DJ, by the time we paid the vendor fee etc etc it probably amounts to the same.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1878111,"PostDate":1415619991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278661\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278661-jeffandrobyn\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jeffandrobyn<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know!\u00a0 But we are not actually hiring a dj.\u00a0 The FI is a dj\/music producer so he's going to set up a premixed set and one of his close friends is also a dj so he can step in if need be.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If we hired an outside DJ, by the time we paid the vendor fee etc etc it probably amounts to the same.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396968452,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.124.40.102","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78294,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"555121b07ebc3599570e075701e377da","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I would definitely keep in mind that weddings are supposed to be fun and many guests do like to dance, so I don&#039;t think it would hurt to rent the dance floor and have fun!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1879321,"PostDate":1417282405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I would definitely keep in mind that weddings are supposed to be fun and many guests do like to dance, so I don't think it would hurt to rent the dance floor and have fun!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blushingbride1988@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.124.40.102","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416236693,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"blushingbride19","Id":281186,"Name":"blushingbride19","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78294","Title":"Reception And Dance Floor Question","LastPostDate":1417282405},"Pages":{"TotalItems":13,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
